<item><title>Tunisia advances Grand Tunis mobility plan toward 2040</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-advances-grand-tunis-mobility-plan-toward-2040-b623d2/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/tn/tunisia-advances-grand-tunis-mobility-plan-toward-2040-b623d2/</guid><category>Tunisia</category><description>The study covers four governorates and will assess transport scenarios before officials select a plan for the region.</description><pubDate>Wed, 18 Nov 2026 08:55:28 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" length="31271" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/tn.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
